{"product_id":"iqos-terea-emerald-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Emerald Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eTerea Cigarette\u003c\/a\u003e Emerald Edition - This flavour can become a real gem of your tobacco collection. You will especially like it if you prefer soft, minty freshness without a strong menthol hit. The whole ensemble is complemented by notes of fresh fruits. There is no unnecessary sweetness in the taste. Each stick is designed for about 14 puffs or 6 minutes of smoking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour of Terea Emerald Edition Indonesia: Fresh fruity and minty scent.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764568727607,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764568760375,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Emerald-Edition.webp?v=1751933276","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-emerald-edition","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




